---
---
<section id="agenda" class="cta-section py-24 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="cta-bg absolute inset-0 z-0"></div>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10">

    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <div class="reveal mb-4 flex justify-center">
        <span class="cta-label">Agenda tu diagnóstico</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1 font-display font-extrabold text-white leading-tight mb-4"
          style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)">
        ¿Listo para ver cuánto está<br/>
        <span class="cta-gradient-text">perdiendo tu negocio sin IA?</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2 text-white/70 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto">
        30 minutos. Sin coste. Con un diagnóstico real y un plan de acción concreto.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <slot />
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-section {
    position: relative;
    background: #1A1033;
  }
  .cta-bg {
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 50%, rgba(147,51,234,0.4) 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 20%, rgba(168,85,247,0.3) 0%, transparent 50%);
  }
  .cta-label {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.73rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #C084FC; background: rgba(192,132,252,0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(192,132,252,0.25);
    border-radius: 99px; padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
  }
  .cta-gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C084FC 0%, #F0ABFC 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }
</style>
